# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep secrets out of it.
#
# .env.local holds DATABASE_URL and the gateway service key. It must never be
# copied into an image: an image is pushed to a registry and pulled by anything
# entitled to that registry, so a credential baked into one has effectively been
# published. Every value it holds is supplied at run time instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.local.example

node_modules
.next
npm-debug.log*

.git
.gitignore

# The throwaway local Agent 1, which is deliberately not part of this repo.
local/

README.md
*.md
!db/*.md
